<div class="home-proof-demo reveal" data-home-proof-demo aria-label="WorkRecorder 从普通截图短板到证据卡的精简演示">
  <div class="proof-stage">
    <div class="proof-window">
      <div class="browser-toolbar">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        <em>任意工作 App · 续约准备</em>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-workspace">
        <article class="proof-app app-pricing active" data-proof-step="scattered">
          <b>材料散落</b>
          <strong>网页、PDF、聊天分在不同窗口。</strong>
          <p>会前刚看过，几分钟后就要重新翻一遍。</p>
          <div class="proof-selection" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </article>
        <article class="proof-app app-chat" data-proof-step="weak">
          <b>普通截图</b>
          <strong>只有画面，没有来源和时间。</strong>
          <p>回头能看见图片，却说不清来自哪里、何时截取、框里文字是什么。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="proof-answer" data-proof-step="evidence">
          <span>WorkRecorder 证据卡</span>
          <strong>截图 + 备注 + App + 时间 + 识别文字。</strong>
          <p>来源：工作 App · 今天 10:42</p>
          <p>框内文字：续约报价、预算偏差、审批说明</p>
        </article>
        <div class="proof-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="proof-output" aria-label="演示进度">
    <div class="proof-card active" data-proof-step="scattered">
      <span>01</span>
      <strong>材料散落</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-card" data-proof-step="weak">
      <span>02</span>
      <strong>截图短板</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-card" data-proof-step="evidence">
      <span>03</span>
      <strong>证据卡</strong>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
